[style name="style"]
join amelia left [animation="Slide From Left" wait="true"]
Not_Name: Hey, you! You!
join main_character right [animation="Slide From Right" wait="true" mirrored="true"]
main_character: Me...?
Not_Name: Yeah, you. I haven't met you. Tell me who you are.
main_character: (Isn't this a university? I thought people minded more their business.)
- You should already know who I am.
	Not_Name: I don't know. It's exciting to meet new people.
	Not_Name: Are you someone famous?
- I'm W-4-VE
	Not_Name: That sounds like a password, not a name.
	Not_Name: You're messing with me, are you?
	main_character: (I need to start thinking about changing my name)
amelia: Nevermind, actually. I'm Amelia, nice to meet you.
amelia: What are you doing here this late?
- I need to achieve the task my maker gave me.
	amelia: Huh? You're religious or something?
	main_character: Nevermind.
	amelia: Weirdo.
	leave amelia [animation="Slide To Left" wait="true"]
	main_character: (I need to get better at this human behaviour thing.)
	leave main_character [animation="Slide To Right" wait="true"]
	[end_timeline]
- I just wanted to chill out between classes. | [if {Dictionary.Chill} == true] [else="disable" alt_text="(I need a more casual way to talk)"]
	amelia: Good idea.
	amelia: Well, next time you can join the radio club to spend some free time here at the university.
	amelia: Maybe even make some new friends since you're new.
	if {Dictionary.Sorry} == false:
		main_character: I've never been very good at that.
		amelia: It's easy. Just say what you're thinking and be straightforward.
		amelia: If you're happy about something, say it. If you're tired of someone's behaviour, tell them. If you're sorry about something, express it.
		amelia: Don't be like those folks who hide their smiles. Who cares what others think?
		main_character: You're right. I'm s-sorry.
		amelia: Never apologised for anything? You must've been a troublesome kid. Repeat after me from the bottom of your heart\: "Sorry".
		main_character: From my mechanical heart, I'm deeply sorry.
		set {Dictionary.Sorry} = true
		amelia: A bit formal, but sure. Sounds sincere enough.
		do GameManager.set_dialogue_wave(true)
	main_character: And where is that radio club you say I can join?
	amelia: Uh, take a look around.
	amelia: There's literally a desk full of microphones.
	main_character: Yeah, sorry.
	amelia: There we go!
	do GameManager.add_wave()
leave amelia [animation="Slide To Left" wait="true"]
leave main_character [animation="Slide To Right" wait="true"]
do GameManager.set_dialogue_on(false)